# Google Pixel Tensor Focused

# Initialize local repository
```
repo init -u https://github.com/Alch3myOS/android -b 16 --git-lfs
```

# Sync up
```
repo sync -c --force-sync -j$(nproc --all)
```

# Build

- Set up the build environment
```bash
. b*/env*
```

- Lunch a target
```bash
lunch lineage_codename-bp4a-user
```

- To ensure changes take
```bash
m installclean
```

- To start compiling
```bash
m bacon
```

- Maintainer prop (define in system/product prop)
```prop
ro.alch3my.maintainer=Libra420T
```

- About phone - Create an rro-overlay for device info  
```prop
https://github.com/Alch3myOS-Devices/device_google_shusky/tree/16/husky/overlay_packages/Alch3mySettingsHusky
```

- For GMS
```make
WITH_GMS := true
```
